  "question": {
    "text": "<p>For the network shown below, the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;_____&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0138_626112743d68.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 130px;\" /></p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "10",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0138_36aa3a26f7a9.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 130px;\" /></p><p>Combined resistance value in the circuit is,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>15</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p><p>Therefore,&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"></math></p>"
  }
